+// ---------------------------------------------------------------- findings of the property test, minimized
+// Each test below is the smallest scenario that breaks an invariant of RandomSequencesKeepAllInvariants.
+// They failed on the module before the fixes of 2026-10-20 and pass since; see the comment of each test.
+
+// n ticks of 20 ms from the current millis(), also across the 32-bit wrap (runUntil() cannot cross it)
+static void ticks(int n)
+{
+    for (int i = 0; i < n; i++) {
+        fakeMs += 20;
+        tickReadIndex = 0;
+        autostartUpdate((timeUs_t)fakeMs * 1000);
+    }
+}
