+// Finding P7 (minor): the boot window test (powerRawChangeMs <= 2.5 s: "the battery powered the board, count the
+// delay from boot") compares raw millis(). After millis() wraps (49.7 days) a battery plugged in within 2.5 s of
+// the wrap is taken for a boot battery and the countdown is counted from millis() == 0: the ramp comes up to
+// 2.5 s before autostart_delay has passed since the plug-in.
+TEST(AutostartFindingTest, PlugRightAfterMillisWrapCountsFromThePlug)
